{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 780 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "c74f89419f1ef1a0193b8d58349be69624924b9497c85e16003e6254dcbd844b" :edb/db-before-t 779 :edb/db-after-t 780 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534092 50 #inst "2026-10-06T02:51:13.757Z" 13194139534092 true] [17592186083302 1020 #edb/ref 17592186277340 13194139534092 true] [17592186083553 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534092 true] [17592186083553 1100 "The quadratic coefficient of a particular quadratic equation equals $3$. The sum of the solutions equals $4$, and the product of the solutions equals $-5$. Find the equation.The equation is\n{{field-1}}\n$= 0$.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"deriving-vietas-formulas\"></a>" 13194139534092 false] [17592186083553 1100 "The quadratic coefficient of a particular quadratic equation equals $3.$ The sum of the solutions equals $4,$ and the product of the solutions equals $-5.$ Find the equation.\n\nThe equation is\n{{field-1}}\n$=0.$" 13194139534092 true] [17592186083553 1145 "Suppose the quadratic equation\n\n$$\na{x}^{2}+bx+c=0\n$$\n\nhas the solutions $x={x}_{1}$ and $x={x}_{2},$ where $a\\ne 0.$ \n\nThen, Vieta's formulas state the following:\n\n- The sum of the solutions is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-\\frac{b}{a}.\n$$\n\n- The product of the solutions is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}=\\frac{c}{a}.\n$$\n\nNow, let's use the given information to determine the values of $a,b,$ and $c$ in this case:\n\n- We're told that the quadratic coefficient equals $3.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\na=3.\n$$\n\n- We're told that the sum of the roots equals $4.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4 & =-\\frac{b}{a} \\\\ 4 & =-\\frac{b}{3} \\\\ -12 & =b \\\\ b & =-12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- We're told that the product of the roots equals $-5.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5 & =\\frac{c}{a} \\\\ -5 & =\\frac{c}{3} \\\\ -15 & =c \\\\ c & =-15.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation has coefficients\n\n$$\na=3,\\,b=-12,\\,c=-15\n$$\n\nand the equation is\n\n$$\n3{x}^{2}-12x-15=0.\n$$" 13194139534092 true] [17592186083556 1100 "Consider the quadratic equation\n\n$$\n9{x}^{2}+7x-27=0.\n$$\n\n**Without** solving the equation, determine the product of its solutions." 13194139534092 true] [17592186083556 1100 "Consider the quadratic equation\n\n$9x^{2} + 7x - 27 = 0$.\n**Without** solving the equation, determine the product of its solutions." 13194139534092 false] [17592186083556 1145 "Suppose the quadratic equation\n\n$$\na{x}^{2}+bx+c=0\n$$\n\nhas the solutions $x={x}_{1}$ and $x={x}_{2},$ where $a\\ne 0.$ \n\nThen, Vieta's formulas state the following:\n\n- The sum of the solutions is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-\\frac{b}{a}.\n$$\n\n- The product of the solutions is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}=\\frac{c}{a}.\n$$\n\nFor the given quadratic equation, we have\n\n$$\na=9,\\,b=7,\\,c=-27.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the product of the solutions is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{c}{a} & =\\frac{(-27)}{9}=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534092 true] [17592186083558 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534092 true] [17592186083558 1100 "The quadratic coefficient of a particular quadratic equation equals $1$. The sum of the solutions equals $7$, and the product of the solutions equals $12$. Find the equation.The equation is\n{{field-1}}\n$= 0$." 13194139534092 false] [17592186083558 1100 "The quadratic coefficient of a particular quadratic equation equals $1.$ The sum of the solutions equals $7,$ and the product of the solutions equals $12.$ Find the equation.\n\nThe equation is\n{{field-1}}\n$=0.$" 13194139534092 true] [17592186083558 1145 "Suppose the quadratic equation\n\n$$\na{x}^{2}+bx+c=0\n$$\n\nhas the solutions $x={x}_{1}$ and $x={x}_{2},$ where $a\\ne 0.$ \n\nThen, Vieta's formulas state the following:\n\n- The sum of the solutions is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-\\frac{b}{a}.\n$$\n\n- The product of the solutions is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}=\\frac{c}{a}.\n$$\n\nNow, let's use the given information to determine the values of $a,b,$ and $c$ in this case:\n\n- We're told that the quadratic coefficient equals $1.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\na=1.\n$$\n\n- We're told that the sum of the roots equals $7.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7 & =-\\frac{b}{a} \\\\ 7 & =-\\frac{b}{1} \\\\ -7 & =b \\\\ b & =-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- We're told that the product of the roots equals $12.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12 & =\\frac{c}{a} \\\\ 12 & =\\frac{c}{1} \\\\ c & =12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation has coefficients\n\n$$\na=1,\\,b=-7,\\,c=12\n$$\n\nand the equation is\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-7x+12=0.\n$$" 13194139534092 true] [17592186259313 1017 #edb/ref 17592186274612 13194139534092 false] [17592186259313 1017 #edb/ref 17592186277334 13194139534092 true] [17592186277334 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277335 13194139534092 true] [17592186277334 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277336 13194139534092 true] [17592186277334 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277337 13194139534092 true] [17592186277334 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277338 13194139534092 true] [17592186277334 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277339 13194139534092 true] [17592186277334 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534092 true] [17592186277334 1041 "selection" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277334 1104 #edb/ref 17592186277335 13194139534092 true] [17592186277334 1110 #uuid "31807062-01e3-53c0-ad59-144335cfcb6a" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277335 1034 "-1\\,041" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277335 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534092 true] [17592186277335 1111 #uuid "7bd40164-3cea-57ff-bf91-53a8ed0e8af8" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277336 1034 "(-2)\\cdot 1\\,041" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277336 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534092 true] [17592186277336 1111 #uuid "4d882fa1-7951-570e-a6b1-81d699d9c470" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277337 1034 "\\frac{-1\\,041}{68}" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277337 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534092 true] [17592186277337 1111 #uuid "84ec2da1-0525-5634-b342-342f070906ae" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277338 1034 "1\\,041" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277338 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534092 true] [17592186277338 1111 #uuid "545396ac-8dfe-5b08-b1e7-2705842a8a55" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277339 1034 "\\frac{68}{2}" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277339 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534092 true] [17592186277339 1111 #uuid "cef7fc8d-1539-5957-ab2d-874f1ae06e6a" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277340 1017 #edb/ref 17592186277341 13194139534092 true] [17592186277340 1089 "q-288828" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277340 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534092 true] [17592186277340 1100 "The quadratic coefficient of a particular quadratic equation equals $4.$ The sum of the solutions equals $-9,$ and the product of the solutions equals $10.$ Find the equation.\n\nThe equation is\n{{field-1}}  \n$=0.$" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277340 1113 #uuid "76b12fa5-6503-51c0-83e1-68af7b86682a" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277340 1145 "Suppose the quadratic equation\n\n$$\na{x}^{2}+bx+c=0\n$$\n\nhas the solutions $x={x}_{1}$ and $x={x}_{2},$ where $a\\ne 0.$ \n\nThen, Vieta's formulas state the following:\n\n- The sum of the solutions is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-\\frac{b}{a}.\n$$\n\n- The product of the solutions is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}=\\frac{c}{a}.\n$$\n\nNow, let's use the given information to determine the values of $a,b,$ and $c$ in this case:\n\n- We're told that the quadratic coefficient equals $4.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\na=4.\n$$\n\n- We're told that the sum of the roots equals $-9.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-9 & =-\\frac{b}{a} \\\\ -9 & =-\\frac{b}{4} \\\\ 36 & =b \\\\ b & =36.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- We're told that the product of the roots equals $10.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10 & =\\frac{c}{a} \\\\ 10 & =\\frac{c}{4} \\\\ 40 & =c \\\\ c & =40.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation has coefficients\n\n$$\na=4,\\,b=36,\\,c=40\n$$\n\nand the equation is\n\n$$\n4{x}^{2}+36x+40=0.\n$$" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277342 13194139534092 true] [17592186277341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186277343 13194139534092 true] [17592186277341 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534092 true] [17592186277341 1041 "field-1" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277341 1104 #edb/ref 17592186277343 13194139534092 true] [17592186277341 1110 #uuid "7eb1caab-a383-5912-84c4-e09bac0bd974" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277342 1034 "4x^2-36x+40" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277342 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534092 true] [17592186277342 1111 #uuid "606d13c4-b4ee-5567-839d-9c2cbdfc938e" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277343 1034 "4x^2+36x+40" 13194139534092 true] [17592186277343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534092 true] [17592186277343 1111 #uuid "e6576356-a247-54de-8a03-04e963ab908d" 13194139534092 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-288826/selection/ma-v1/d4a9fd0fbcda102652b25ce17f81433b6f70dbe05bf3659dfb16684e3326fd10" 17592186277334 "q-288826/selection/ma-v1/d4a9fd0fbcda102652b25ce17f81433b6f70dbe05bf3659dfb16684e3326fd10/10a397003054297a4c7331113bef0a0c62436780b89b7ca02c7e15879d2b3aa6" 17592186277335 "q-288826/selection/ma-v1/d4a9fd0fbcda102652b25ce17f81433b6f70dbe05bf3659dfb16684e3326fd10/35337d880addb4395508f685da3ad02896d590c4f49c77bb687940c28be42a6c" 17592186277336 "q-288826/selection/ma-v1/d4a9fd0fbcda102652b25ce17f81433b6f70dbe05bf3659dfb16684e3326fd10/5e867d6a3aa1c8efd5381a21ccd533f0e80a060960681eec985b2d7d5fbdfa24" 17592186277337 "q-288826/selection/ma-v1/d4a9fd0fbcda102652b25ce17f81433b6f70dbe05bf3659dfb16684e3326fd10/9b5fcbc14dd17889d1e3d6ce64c132b4de22bbbdff0d6a7286cba7a678e149db" 17592186277338 "q-288826/selection/ma-v1/d4a9fd0fbcda102652b25ce17f81433b6f70dbe05bf3659dfb16684e3326fd10/e8067fecb4e865962f62cfcaa005c40a614a20b00b72c3711e09c752e22647f9" 17592186277339 "q-288828" 17592186277340 "q-288828/field-1" 17592186277341 "q-288828/field-1/5c7ce1db084ccc7fab49f298e2a896362a591a8c5e9a604